, the Goethe Prize, the Frankfurt Peace Prize and the 2013 Franz Kafka Prize. He died in 2018 at the age of ... \",\"title\":\"https://www.cbc.ca/books/30-books-to-celebrate-30-years-of-writers-company-1.5755144\"}],\"next_step\":\"Inspect navigation; read a relevant page or change the locating clue.\",\"observation\":{\"first_delivered_source_round\":null,\"prior_deliveries\":0,\"query_key\":\"3a555667586fe271edab94218e1000312e9710dd563e10f991cca1ac5c36925a\",\"replay_requested\":false,\"result_fingerprint\":\"08d3f55071f70de92a0ee1a02ba855dbf37f79f1fcde72e6c9a343c5e16b390d\",\"semantic_progress\":\"not_measured\"},\"query\":\"International Booker Prize Wikipedia winners 2016 2017 2018 2019\",\"view\":\"full\"},{\"cached\":false,\"hits\":[{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":true,\"previously_received\":true,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d10\"},\"ref\":\"d10\",\"snippet\":\" ... Literature Award, 1999\\n\\n- Best Local Author, NOW Magazine Readers' Poll, 1999\\n\\n2000-2010:\\n\\n- Best Local Author, NOW Magazine Readers' Poll, 2000\\n\\n- Winner Booker Prize for The Blind Assassin, 2000\\n\\n- Nominated for the Orange Prize, 2001\\n\\n- International Crimewriters Assocation Dashiell Hammett Award, 2001\\n\\n- Canadian Booksellers Association People's Choice ... \",\"title\":\"https://margaretatwood.ca/awards-recognitions/\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":true,\"previously_received\":true,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d29\"},\"ref\":\"d29\",\"snippet\":\" ... July 2025, shortlist 23 September, winner 10 November | Longlist to be announced 29 July 2025, shortlist 23 September, winner 10 November | *Roddy Doyle (chair) * Ayọ̀bámi Adébáyọ̀ * Sarah Jessica Parker * Chris Power * Kiley Reid |\\n\\n2* Awarded in 2010 as the Lost Man Booker Prize\\n\\nWriters with multiple awards\\n\\nFive ... \",\"title\":\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_winners_and_nominated_authors